ing sounds of smaller pebbles and dust, with distant rumbling of the remaining rockfall subsiding.\",\"resolution\":{\"W\":1280,\"H\":720},\"aspect_ratio\":\"16,9\",\"duration\":\"7s\",\"fps\":24}", "seed": 17, "use_duration_template": false, "use_resolution_template": false, "width": 1280}, "status": "pass", "task": "i2v"}
